cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Drone / Phone Video to Walkable 3D World"
abstract: >-
  An open-source pipeline that turns a single drone or phone video into a walkable,
  physics-backed 3D world. It combines COLMAP structure-from-motion, gsplat 3D Gaussian
  Splatting training with a VRAM-derived budget, metric scale and gravity recovery, a
  voxel collision mesh and an automated world gate with a headless walk test, plus a
  Ground Control Station and a survey lane for georeferenced deliverables.
authors:
